{'symbol': 'UNH', 'date': '2021-11-23 08:00:00', 'title': "UNITEDHEALTHCARE COMMUNITY PLAN OF RHODE ISLAND PROVIDED $110,000 TO SUPPORT CHILDREN'S HEALTH", 'text': 'PROVIDENCE, R.I.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--UNITEDHEALTHCARE, A UNITEDHEALTH GROUP (NYSE: UNH) COMPANY, HAS PROVIDED $110,000 IN INVESTMENTS IN THE PAST SEVERAL MONTHS TO COMMUNITY-BASED ORGANIZATIONS IN RHODE ISLAND TO SUPPORT CHILDREN AND THEIR FAMILIES WITH HEALTH EDUCATION, ADVOCACY AND HEALTHY MEALS. "WE\'RE HONORED TO BE INVESTING IN LOCAL ORGANIZATIONS THAT OFFER RESOURCES TO CHILDREN AND THEIR FAMILIES TO ADDRESS SOCIAL FACTORS THAT HAVE A PROFOUND IMPACT ON THEIR HEALTH," SAID PATRICE COOPER, CH'}